 "limits": [
  "One machine and loopback networking; the probe shares the CPU with the services. Not a capacity claim for any deployment.",
  "Rates are new games started per second; each game also holds a socket for about 10.5 s, so 40 a second means roughly 420 player sockets plus 50 watchers.",
  "The profile steps are single runs; the 40/s A/B has two runs per variant.",
  "Synthetic players with planned taps; no real devices, browsers or mobile networks.",
  "The profile did not exceed 40 new runs a second, so the saturation point was not reached; leaderboard-svc CPU was the resource growing fastest."
 ]
}
